nd ethereum are by no  means making new all-time highs they've  actually been holding up extremely well  given that they're down less than  companies like netflix and paypal with  that being said though we have yet to  see any meaningful move towards  inflation hedges meaning that all the  money people are cashing out of the  stock market and the bond market is just  in cash and this is keeping demand for  the dollar quite high  at the end of the day the main takeaway  from all of this is that despite all the  fed's quantitative easing the dollar is  actually still holding up extremely  strong from a global perspective now  this does not help by any means for  inflation or prices after all if the u.s  has a 10 inflation rate while the rest  of the world has a 15 inflation rate the  dollar would still be performing  extremely well in relation the main  factor is driving forward the dollar  right now it is an enormous amount of  money printing from other countries  extreme uncertainty in the market  regarding the fed and the very low  inflation hedging taking place  looking forward whether this momentum  will continue or not comes down to the  threat stands over the next couple of  months and whether inflation starts to  cool down substantially if inflation  cools down and the fed backs off then  it's very possible that we enter a risk  on market once again and during a risk  on market people don't hold cash rather  they invest it all into assets which  drives down the demand for the dollar  this could cause the dxy to stagnate or  even start running down on the other  hand if inflation continues to get worse  and the fed becomes even more hawkish  the market might become even more risk  off causing the dollar to reach levels  that it hasn't seen in decades but we'll  just have to wait and see do you guys  think the dxy is going up or down  comment that down below  also drop a like if you're hoping that  inflation cools off sooner rather than  later and of course consider checking  out our international channels to watch  your videos in other languages and  consider subscribing to see more  questions logically answered but until  then i'm hari and i'll see you guys on  the next one  you

